<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h281f6f47g8423g42a8gb83cg2e8c00bbc5cf" version="1">Rhythm of the Hunt</content>
	<content contentuid="he3795c57g65beg4456g8d8egeb08b1bd56fe" version="1">You gain &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt; against targets under &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HUNTERS_MARK"&gt;Hunter's Mark&lt;/LSTag&gt;. When you kill a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HUNTERS_MARK"&gt;marked target&lt;/LSTag&gt;, you regain a &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;Bonus Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h4c0605fcg9cb7g4b47g8c68gfeaa7de8bbdf" version="1">Call of the Hunt</content>
	<content contentuid="h547a0382gb1f6g4a68g93e8g42938ab546cf" version="1">When you deal damage with a &lt;b&gt;weapon&lt;/b&gt;, a target under &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HUNTERS_MARK"&gt;Hunter's Mark&lt;/LSTag&gt; takes an additional &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(damage type follows your equipped weapon)&lt;/i&gt;.</content>
